hadiths[25]{hadithnumber,text}:
"915","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab ghulam apne Rabb aur apne aaqa ki ita'at kare to us ke liye do ajr hain.'"
"916","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh shakhs jo hikmat aur samajh ki baat sune, lekin jo sune use bure tareeqe se le — us ki misal us aadmi ki si hai jo charwahe ke paas aae aur kahe: Aey charwahe! Mujhe apni bakriyon mein se ek bakri gosht ke liye de. Charwaha kahe: Jao aur sab se achchi bakri pakdo. To woh (jakar) rewad ke kutte ka kaan pakad le.'"
"917","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey Allah! Khandan Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko zaroorat ke mutabiq rizq ata farma.'"
"918","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sohbat mein Madina ke khajooron ke baghat mein chal raha tha, ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey Abu Hurairah! Kasrat maal wale halak honge. Beshak kasrat maal wale sab se kamtar honge, siwae us ke jo aise, aise, aur aise kharch kare' — yani apne aage, peeche, dayen, aur baen. Phir unhon ne aakhir tak bayan kiya jaise pichli hadees mein (no. 266, 265)."
"919","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah farmata hai: Buzurgi Meri chadar hai aur izzat Mera «إزار» hai. To jo un mein se kisi ko Mujh se chheenne ki koshish kare, Main use jahannam mein phenkunga.'"
"920","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Hamen kya hai ke jab ham Aap ke sath hote hain to goya hamare dil aakhirat se lage hote hain; lekin jab ham Aap ko chhod kar apne ghar walon se milte hain to yeh kaifiyat ham se chali jati hai?' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar tumhari kaifiyat mere paas se jane ke baad waisi rahe jaisi mere sath hone par hai, to farishte tum se apne hathon se musafaha karen, tumhare gharon mein tumhari ziyarat karen; aur agar tum gunah na karo to Allah aise log laega jo gunah karenge phir bakhsh diye jayenge.' Main ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe batayen: makhlooq kis se paida ki gai?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Pani se.' Main ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe jannat aur us ki tameer ke bare mein batayen.' Phir rawi ne Isa wali riwayat ki manind bayan ki aur aakhir tak jari rakha, aur kaha: '«مسک» (mushk) «أذخر» us ka gara hai, aur us ke kankar moti, jawahrat, aur yaqoot hain.' Aur unhon ne kaha: 'Adil badshah ki dua radd nahin hoti.'"
"921","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Meri ummat ke badtareen log woh hain jo ni'maton mein pale aur un ke jism un par bade hue.'"
"922","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo duniya ko halal tareeqe se talab kare, doosron se mangne se bachna chahe, apne ghar walon ki zarooraten poori kare, aur apne padosi se husn sulook kare, to woh Qayamat ke din aaega jabke us ka chehra chaudhwin raat ke chaand ki manind hoga. Aur jo duniya ko halal tareeqe se fakhr, muqabla, aur riya ke liye talab kare, to woh Allah se is haal mein milega ke Woh us par ghazabnak hoga.'"
"923","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah danishmand, hoshiyar, aur (bila zaroorat) mangne se bachne walon se muhabbat farmata hai. Aur Woh gandi zaban wale, buri guftagu wale, aur zid se mangne (mutalba karne) walon ko napasand farmata hai.'"
"924","[AI-translation] Aur isi se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ke zikr ki taraf, to ruko (aur tawajjoh do).'"
"925","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne un se farmaya: 'Kya tum jante ho «نميمة» kya hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool behtar jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh logon ki baten doosron tak pahunchana hai taake un ke darmiyan fasaad paida ho.' Aur Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar aadmi ke paas maal se bhari do wadiyan hon to woh teesri wadi talab karega. Aadmi ke pet ko mitti (qabr) ke siwa kuch nahin bharega, aur Allah jise chahta hai bakhshta hai.'"
"926","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Shaitan insani jism mein gardish karta hai; to jab Allah use ek darwaze se bachata hai to woh doosre darwaze se aata hai yahan tak ke us ka kuch hissa halak kar de.'"
"927","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ta'ajjub hai ke log «لا إله إلا الله» aur «الله أكبر» kahna chhodte hain; raha main, main sirf chahunga ke takbeer achchi tarah ada ki jae. Shaitan shakhs par gunah ki taraf se hamla karta hai; to jab us se hifazat ho jati hai to phir woh us par naik a'mal ki taraf se hamla karta hai taake woh sunnat chhod de aur bid'at kare."
"928","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Main jannat mein dakhil hua aur main ne us ke rehne walon ko dekha; un mein aksariyat miskeenon ki thi.'"
"929","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Madina ki masjid (Masjid Nabawi) mein ek namaz padhna doosri masjidon mein hazaar namazon se behtar hai, siwae Ka'ba (Makkah mein Masjid Haram) ke.'"
"930","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar tum woh jante jo main janta hun to tum kam hanste aur zyada rote. Lekin qareeb raho, seedhe raho, aur khushkhabri qabool karo.'"
"931","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen tumhare behtareen logon ke bare mein na bataun?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Kyun nahin.' Aap ne farmaya: '(Tumhare behtareen log) woh hain jinhen jab tum dekho to woh tumhen Allah yaad dilayen. Kya main tumhen tumhare badtareen logon ke bare mein na bataun?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Kyun nahin, Ya Rasulullah!' Aap ne farmaya: 'Chughal khor, doston mein fasaad dalne wale, aur bigad aur shar talab karne wale.'"
"932","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah se milne se muhabbat kare, Allah us se milne se muhabbat farmata hai; aur jo Allah se milne ko napasand kare, Allah us se milne ko napasand farmata hai. Aur Allah se milne se pahle maut hai.'"
"933","[AI-translation] Masruq se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aaya aur woh ro rahi thin. Main ne un se kaha: Aey Ummul Momineen! Tum kyun ro rahi ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main khane se sair hoti hun aur rone ko ji chahta hai, to main rone lagti hun; aur yeh is liye hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wafat tak ek din mein do martaba gehn ki roti sair ho kar nahin khai."
"934","[AI-translation] Aishah bint Talhah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Husn sulook aur sila rahmi ka sawab naik a'mal mein sab se jald milta hai; aur zulm aur qata' rahmi ka azab tamam buraiyon mein sab se jald milta hai.'"
"935","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke bete apni phuphi (Fatimah bint Yaman Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) beemar hue, to main chand Muhajir auraton ke sath Aap ki dekhbhal ke liye aai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pani ki mashk latkai thi, aur woh qatra qatra Aap ke seene par tapak rahi thi. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Is ne Aap ko takleef di hai; Allah se dua karen ke woh Aap se yeh takleef door farmaye. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ambiya (Alaihimussalam) sab se sakht aazmae jate hain, phir un se qareeb wale, phir un ke baad wale.'"
"936","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fatimah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main chand auraton ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki mizaj pursi ke liye aai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pani ki mashk latkai thi — phir rawi ne pichli ki manind hadees zikr ki."
"937","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fatimah (bint Yaman Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main chand auraton ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui, aur dekha ke Aap ne pani ki mashk latkai thi aur — jo dard Aap mahsoos farma rahe the us ki wajah se — us ka pani qatra qatra Aap par tapkaya ja raha tha. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua karen ke Woh Aap ka dard door farmaye. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sab se sakht aazmaishen tamam Ambiya (Alaihimussalam) par aati hain, phir un ke baad walon par, phir un ke baad walon par, aur phir un ke baad walon par.'"
"938","[AI-translation] Ubaid Sanuta se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Umm Muhammad (Khaulah bint Qais Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aaya, jo Hamzah bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziyallahu anhu) ki biwi thin. Un ke baad Hanzalah nami aadmi ne un se nikah kiya. Unhon (Khaulah) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din Hamzah ki beti ke paas tashreef laae, aur us ne Aap ko umara ke bare mein bataya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Duniya hari bhari aur meethi hai; to jo us mein se us ke haq ke sath le, Allah us ke liye us mein barkat farmayega. Kabhi, us ke liye jo Allah ke maal mein apni khwahish ke mutabiq ghuse, Qayamat ke din jahannam ki aag hogi.'"
"939","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) yeh kasrat se farmate the, is liye main nahin janta ke woh cheez hai jise Aap behtar samajhte the ya Kitabullah mein se hai: 'Agar aadmi ke paas maal se bhari do wadiyan hon to woh un jaisi teesri chahega; us ke nafs ko (qabr ki) mitti ke siwa kuch nahin bharega. Jo tauba kare, Allah us ki tauba qabool farmata hai.'"
